# Pairs with TypeOK. A capture starts with no id left to allocate.
MODULE: TypeOkIdRunaway
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a capture allocates an id past the bound
PERTURBS: Start

--- FIND
    /\ next <= MaxIds
    /\ k = "full" => b = 0
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no id bound.
    /\ next <= MaxIds + 1
    /\ k = "full" => b = 0
--- END